nd data science focuses on collecting, interpretting, categorizing, strategizing, analyzing and optmising data. It is a specialised branch that deals with the development of data driven solutions, data visualization tools and techniques to analyse big data meta data, complex image and video analysis. It also incorporates the concepts of machine learning (particularly, deep learning) model building for solving various computational and real world problems. It also includes, process optimisation and information fusion for decision making in order to enhance efficiency, productivity and reduce cost. For more details Architecture Architecture has been defined differently throughout history, and its practice has always been shaped by the advancement of innovative technology. The beginning of the 21st century is no different. Technology such as Artificial Intelligence (AI) has been dominating every aspect of our built environment. CamTech\u2019s Architecture Program is designed to equip students with skills to use the technology ethically, and the core of it is the smart Design Studio which encourages students to have in-depth understanding of building structures and critical issues in architectural design. Students will be able to immerse themselves in new cutting-edge technology in construction and produce more sustainable buildings for Cambodia and the world. The studies of architectural history, digital fabrication or the cities will prepare students well for a competitive job market locally and internationally. We empower students to use new digital tools (AI, data analysis, 3D modelling for design, virtual reality, etc.) to enable optimal design, sustainable architecture, and energy efficient safe environment. In addition, CamTech offers work-integrated learning experience to develop students\u2019 employability, entrepreneurial, and leadership skills. For more details Business Intelligence A Bachelor&#8217;s degree in Risk Management and Business Intelligence is a program that provides students with a comprehensive understanding of the intersection between business analytics, information technology, and risk management. The study combines theoretical concepts with practical applications in order to prepare students to analyse data and make informed decisions that mitigate business risks and improve organizational performance. Students learn to develop risk management strategies, assess potential threats to businesses, evaluate financial risks, and analyse market trends. They also gain skills in data mining, statistical analysis, decision-making, database management, and software development. The program covers topics such as business intelligence, strategic management, enterprise risk management, fraud detection and prevention, cyber security, and compliance. Graduates can pursue careers in various industries, including finance, insurance, healthcare, government, and consulting firms. Overall, a Bachelor&#8217;s degree in Risk Management and Business Intelligence provides students with a strong foundation in both technical and business skills, making them well-equipped to succeed in today&#8217;s data-driven business world. For more details Cyber Security Security breaches, IoT security issues, ransomware, spam and phishing attack, and malware attacks are now everywhere. In this Cybersecurity program, you will learn how to protect yourself, your servers and your network from compromising data, cybercriminals, malicious and hackers, especially find the vulnerability in your system and gain a deep understanding of cyber-attack methods. Working with industry experts, you will learn the cybersecurity challenges of organisations, infrastructures, technologies, citizens, and national security. Engaging with a wide range of stakeholders, you will also understand the growing demands of the market, opportunities for entrepreneurship and leadership of national security. For more details Robotics and AI Robotics and automation push productivity to new levels. Leaving your smart-home with the help of smart assistance on your phone, go to work in the agriculture fields that automatically water your plants and report back to your the nutrition in the soil. Smart industry production chain that provide efficiently working schedule and targets in each production lines for optimal output. Will you push it even further? Will you solve tomorrow\u2019s challenges with innovation for economical growth of Cambodia and the world? The Robotics and Automation Engineering program is home to problem-solvers and independent thinkers. A community of creators with a drive to demand more from technology and from themselves with entrepreneur mindset. From electrical and electronics to mechatronics and robotics, students learn the complexity of automated systems used in the world of robotics and automation. It doesn\u2019t stop there. An understanding of vision systems, networking, and software applications with smart decision making logic rounds out the experience. For more details Software Engineering Software not only makes your computer hardware perform important tasks but can also help ensure the efficiency of the services\/operations of every sector in your organization. Software engineering is the backbone of all software systems and focuses more on applying techniques that ensure the successful completion of a high-quality product. It incorporates the system architecture, logic, connections, algorithms, security, etc. This is the most appropriate major to develop your skills for design-based coding, mobile app development, website development, intelligent system development using AI, immersive (AR\/VR) technology-based application development, secure application development, industry4.0-related application, and service-related software application development. Software engineering helps enhance the efficiency of services, increase the productivity of your business, and, in many cases, reduce production costs. Overall, software engineering is the heart of modern digital technology that will definitely help you find a career in almost every area of software development. CamTech offers work-integrated learning experience to ensure students\u2019 employability, entrepreneurial and leadership skills. For more details No. Majors of Study Tuition Fee\/year 4-year Tuition Fee 1 AI and Data Science $4,000 $16,000 2 Architecture $4,000 $16,000 3 Business Intelligence $3,500 $14,000 4 Cyber Security $4,000 $16,000 5 Robotics and AI $4,000 $16,000 6 Software Engineering $4,000 $16,000 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":4,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"elementor_header_footer","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-14728","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry","post-no-thumbnail"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/14728","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/4"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=14728"}],"version-history":[{"count":6,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/14728\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":39120,"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/14728\/revisions\/39120"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/camtech.edu.kh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=14728"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}